{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-27","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a rational rectangle.","book":10,"number":27,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.27","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.27/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":27,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","contentId":"euclid-10-27","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39b3ccd2630b228a21c991cae9320ec7885305e3d6326b4c8ff8e320e533e7b5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-27.statement","euclid-10-27.construction.1","euclid-10-27.proof.1","euclid-10-27.proof.2","euclid-10-27.proof.3","euclid-10-27.proof.4","euclid-10-27.proof.5","euclid-10-27.proof.6","euclid-10-27.proof.7","euclid-10-27.proof.8","euclid-10-27.proof.9","euclid-10-27.conclusion","euclid-10-27.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-27.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a9952cb711790677cd6640c6c044bb8c9bd874c9618eacc929994abb38fdec0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a rational rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度 包含有理 矩形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad41253cb259fd6963090e4094127513b25927457e146035cadb34c65752bb3e","citations":["euclid-6-13","euclid-6-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two rational straight lines A, B commensurable in square only be set out; let C be taken a mean proportional between A, B, [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)] and let it be contrived that, as A is to B, so is C to D. [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出2,有理线段,A,B,平方可公度而长度不可公度;从A到B间比例中项架A比B等于C比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)] [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b5d877df48fc34573a9bd896de197ba63c60912f96c4b30cdda41e36ac4719a5","citations":["euclid-6-17","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since A, B are rational and commensurable in square only, the rectangle A, B, that is, the square on C [[VI.17](/principles/euclid-6-17)], is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B是有理,平方可公度而长度不可公度,中项无理线段,矩形,A,B,即C,中项无理线段,中项无理线段。 [[VI.17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ccf407562aee2cbdc7f0809a448fc772da487bd0529e845cda7e09ef029655c","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以C是中项无理线段 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d26a5c5fdfd7836d9fcff6298870340698fde3e8224e6d28b5e6f4133bbf51fc","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and A, B are commensurable in square only, therefore C, D are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比B等于C比D,A比平方可公度而长度不可公度,B等于平方可公度而长度不可公度,C比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fd14d5604ee29a417670a9598e3aec2c264afd21667430b345e967f0cf96a6d","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And C is medial; therefore D is also medial. [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23), addition]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C是中项无理线段,D也是中项无理线段,加号 [ [X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0368ced60ce160953c438d87b17d34cef8714944dcbde1505be95d054882db16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C, D are medial and commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C、D是中项无理线段和平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b877d076738a41ba01c06e4562297320a26ab8db485b4331a5f8ebfa3f20f6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that they also contain a rational rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们也包含有理 矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98e3b3739c8669a8aa7736dd64a01171cd77d8edf7b3795bfe2781c7efc77c57","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as A is to B, so is C to D, therefore, alternately, as A is to C, so is B to D. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比B等于C比D,因此,A比C等于C比C；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"537aa0073361b6703d0f241fb41a700c5c24ec35fbab6a76c7ee9fc168c418e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to C, so is C to B; therefore also, as C is to B, so is B to D; therefore the rectangle C, D is equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对C的比等于C对B的比;因此,C对B的比等于B对D的比;因此,矩形对C对D的比等于B对B的比；A 与 C 之比等于 C 与 B 之比；C 与 B 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1016adb056c201c76c11b2c695e803995b932e04cb9dcfff4c47b03f9daab2d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on B is rational; therefore the rectangle C, D is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但B正方形是有理,矩形CD也是有理"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b7e5dcdb7ff584ecf30a1862b05a87c5c91c0ef45f04f8db92d088a7c3beba4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore medial straight lines commensurable in square only have been found which contain a rational rectangle. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度件,其中含有有理 矩形件,Q件,E件,D件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-27.source","contentId":"euclid-10-27","revisionId":"euclid-10-27@raw-39b3ccd2630b228a","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52227a187c6e5084a5fa88c08f9b1a54aafc6f0f978702410235b9db0dee3b73","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.27/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1